@startuml CommentsController Sequence Diagram

title CommentsController Sequence Diagram

actor User
participant "CommentsController" as CC
participant "CommentService" as CS
database Database

== Get Comments for Ad ==
User -> CC: GET /ads/{id}/comments
CC -> CS: getCommentsOnAd(id)
CS -> Database: Query comments by ad ID
Database --> CS: Return comments list
CS --> CC: Comments DTO
CC --> User: 200 OK, Comments DTO

== Add Comment ==
User -> CC: POST /ads/{id}/comments (text)
CC -> CS: addCommentToAd(id, text)
CS -> Database: Create comment
Database --> CS: Created comment
CS --> CC: Comment DTO
CC --> User: 200 OK, Comment DTO

== Delete Comment ==
User -> CC: DELETE /ads/{adId}/comments/{commentId}
CC -> CS: deleteCommentToAdId(adId, commentId)
CS -> Database: Delete comment
Database --> CS: Deletion confirmation
CS --> CC: 200 OK
CC --> User: 200 OK

== Update Comment ==
User -> CC: PATCH /ads/{adId}/comments/{commentId} (CreateOrUpdateComment)
CC -> CS: updatingComment(adId, commentId, createOrUpdateComment)
CS -> Database: Update comment
Database --> CS: Update confirmation
CS --> CC: Updated Comment DTO
CC --> User: 200 OK, Updated Comment DTO

@enduml